OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court over fatal crash
OL,4,Awhich killed six
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court charged
OL,7,Fwith causing the deaths of six people,
OL,8,Fincluding two young sisters, in a
OL,9,Fcrash.
OL,11,FFour members of the same family and a
OL,12,Fmarried couple were killed in the crash
OL,13,Fon the A61 between Barnsley and
OL,14,FWakefield in July 2024.
OL,16,FShane Roller, 33, his partner Shannen
OL,17,FMorgan, 30, and their daughters, Rubie
OL,18,Fand Lillie Morgan-Roller, aged nine and
OL,19,Ffour, died when their Ford Focus car
OL,20,Fcollided with a motorbike being ridden
OL,21,Fby Christopher and Janine Barton.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
