OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court over fatal crash
OL,4,Awhich killed six
OL,5,
OL,6,FChristopher Cockell, 50, of Gresford
OL,7,FClose, Woolley Grange, Barnsley,
OL,8,Fappeared at Leeds Magistrates' Court
OL,9,Fcharged with six counts of causing
OL,10,Fdeath by dangerous driving and one
OL,11,Fcount of failing to stop after a road
OL,12,Faccident.
